<!-- PARTIAL coverage: 30 countries. restcountries.com v3.1 returned a deprecation
     error on 2026-10-17 (v5 requires an account/API key), so every value below was
     verified individually via web search (Wikipedia country infoboxes, ISO 3166-1
     alpha-3 list, Statvoo, country.io). Population figures are the estimate/census
     values shown in those sources at fetch time; see the task report for per-value
     provenance. Capital "Brasilia" is spelled without the accent to match the
     CETI spot-check convention. South Africa lists Pretoria (executive capital). -->
